    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffLocalWorkflowServer` is the local workflow server module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for local workflow server activation and runtime topology. Workflow behavior belongs in workflow modules and framework BPM contracts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Local workflow settings should preserve auditability, rollback expectations, and layered overrides."
    }
